{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>מבלתי</b> Twice in the Masorah: מבלתי יכולת ה' and the other: ותזנו אל בני אשור מבלתי שבעתך — on the theme of the abominations of Jerusalem, as it were, that the sins of Israel press against the force (יד חזקה) where there is no capacity." "<b>וישחטם במדבר</b> The חי\"ת (= 418) of שחוטה is cut, to say that they transgressed the Torah for which He cut eight covenants in general and eight covenants in particular, and therefore He gave permission to the angels of destruction to exact punishment for their sin."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:08.407329860Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}